00:44:10.050 --> 00:44:13.935
units you might want to consider eliminating the special permit.

00:44:14.495 --> 00:44:19.215
Not a lot it's not a lot different than a single family subdivision

00:44:19.215 --> 00:44:20.655
a little more dense

00:44:21.615 --> 00:44:25.215
but you might want but the special permit probably isn't necessary

00:44:27.030 --> 00:44:28.070
I don't think

00:44:28.390 --> 00:44:32.150
but and but then again you might want to say and you can have

00:44:32.790 --> 00:44:35.990
I think right now you allow six bedrooms per acre

