00:44:59.640 --> 00:45:00.600
You have an

00:45:02.040 --> 00:45:07.720
mixed use floating zone which was created which I wrote to incorporate an optional affordable

00:45:07.835 --> 00:45:24.000
component in exchange for higher density and a more more straightforward less risky approval process this zone is on the books already the Andover mixed use floating zone it floats over properties that that front on Route 6 so it's just along Route 6

