Right now it's a floating zone you have to go through a zone change process

00:45:45.115 --> 00:45:53.060
to apply it to the piece of land. Then you go through the special permit process to develop it. The zone change process costs

00:45:53.060 --> 00:45:56.980
a lot of money. You have to come up with a conceptual plan and whatnot. It's just a

00:45:58.020 --> 00:45:59.940
